                Ratpoison prefers C-t to indicate Ctrl + t THEN release keys
                run box is handy to remember C-t !
                full list of keybindings is C-t ? 

                TCEs...dep=dependency
                config made nano default & dep ( my preference)
                sgmenu and its doc TCE if interested...not a dep
                .......allows generate and navigate menu by kb or mouse
                config made mc default file manager but not a dep 
                To use the nicer left pointer suggest you use lxappearance
                with xcursor-themes....none are deps  
               
